OL,3,GNEWSAAttempt to block new park and ride
OL,4,Acharges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to introduce charges at a free
OL,7,Fpark and ride site with hundreds of
OL,8,Fspaces is being challenged.
OL,10,FPlymouth City Council wants to bring in
OL,11,Fa maximum charge of #3.50 a day for
OL,12,Fanyone who parks at the George park and
OL,13,Fride site on the outskirts of the city
OL,14,Ffor more than six hours.
OL,16,FThe Labour-run council said it was
OL,17,Fintroducing the charges as a growing
OL,18,Fnumber of people were using the site
OL,19,Ffor parking but without using the park
OL,20,Fand ride service.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
